  "notes": [
    "Use this manifest to decide which packaged files Cadet may update during bootstrap sync.",
    "If managed framework files are updated, require a fresh chat before continuing.",
    "Treat the packaged zip as a universal bootstrap package rather than the long-term source of truth.",
    "As of v0.5.0, the agent instruction set is condensed into cadet-agent.md. Full rationale, guidance, standards, and templates are in the docs/ directory (GitHub Pages).",
    "As of the harness modernization, .cadet/harness.json (policy overrides) and .cadet/runs/ (sanitized run ledgers) are preserved by sync and never deleted.",
    "As of v0.28.0, install/sync write a .cadet/.repo-role marker (consumer-project|framework-source) so the framework-source vs consumer-project boundary is machine-checkable. It is neither a managed nor a preserved path."
